{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2021-08-23 16:30:00', 'title': 'WEST ELECTS NEW DIRECTOR TO THE BOARD', 'text': "EXTON, PA., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC.\xa0(NYSE: WST), A GLOBAL LEADER IN INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS FOR INJECTABLE DRUG ADMINISTRATION, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED\xa0MOLLY JOSEPH\xa0AS ITS NEWEST MEMBER. \xa0WITH THE ADDITION OF MS."}